rap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 重装冲锋侧影.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b3/llgym7qqgevdinim20trqn0jengm588.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%87%8D%E8%A3%85%E5%86%B2%E9%94%8B%E4%BE%A7%E5%BD%B1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b3/llgym7qqgevdinim20trqn0jengm588.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%87%8D%E8%A3%85%E5%86%B2%E9%94%8B%E4%BE%A7%E5%BD%B1.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b3/llgym7qqgevdinim20trqn0jengm588.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />重装冲锋\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>远程、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓1-↑1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>自身十字\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>(穿透伤害)[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同号令\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同号令</font></span></span>]，选择目标进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冲锋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冲锋</font></span></span>]，若目标为敌人，则冲锋至其身边并造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">80%</font>物攻值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果:移动力增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格。主动攻击后，可再移动，距离为剩余移动力。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-4 自身十字.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/ae/2g4wzkf6vt8qazxkikoihxryctbn1c4.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-4_%E8%87%AA%E8%BA%AB%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"81\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/ae/2g4wzkf6vt8qazxkikoihxryctbn1c4.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-4_%E8%87%AA%E8%BA%AB%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/ae/2g4wzkf6vt8qazxkikoihxryctbn1c4.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-4_%E8%87%AA%E8%BA%AB%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"171\" data-file-height=\"174\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%BA%A6%E8%8E%8E\" title=\"角色图鉴库/麦莎\"><img alt=\"头像 麦莎.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/50/eounwkdf710if05ezozbxkhmzgq00i1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">麦莎</font